12 CFR § 329.104 ('ASF factors') covers the following: (a) NSFR regulatory capital elements and NSFR liabilities assigned a 100 percent ASF factor. An NSFR regulatory capital element or NSFR liability of an FDIC-supervised institution is assigned a 100 percent ASF factor if it is one of the following:
(1) An NSFR regulatory capital element;

