12 CFR § 332.11 ('Limits on redisclosure and reuse of information') covers the following: (a)(1) Information you receive under an exception. If you receive nonpublic personal information from a nonaffiliated financial institution under an exception in § 332.14 or 332.15 of this part, your disclosure and use of that information is limited as follows:
